Z||000007||84Bill||05-22-2001||07:08 PM||||Behold the all new 2001 Pontiac Fiero GTO <P>Hardcore driving enthusiasts, step right up–The Fiero GTO is for you. The ultimate muscle car is equipped with a standard 310-horsepower V8 engine and is available with a traction control system to maximize traction during acceleration on slippery surfaces. The Coupe's removable hatch roof is perfect on a sunny day. And the two-sided PTE injection molded doors resist dents, dings, and rust. In fact, there are many great rewards to being behind the wheel of this legend...but you knew that.<P>Don't blink-this bad boy's powerful. Formula's standard features include 16" 5-spoke cast aluminum wheels and a 5.7-liter V8 with 310 horsepower. The Formula is also available with traction control and standard 4-speed automatic transmission.<P><BR>Or for you economy minded that still want punch at a bargain price. Slide behind the wheel of this Bold, powerful, and ready to give you a run for your money, Fiero GT features a high-revving 3800 Series II SFI V6 pumping out 200 horsepower, and a 500-watt peak power Delco Monsoon sound® system1, and a cockpit environment designed for the serious driver. Which means Fiero is sure to satisfy your appetite for the road<P>We can't build any more excitement than this. Guaranteed!<P>Well it wiuld have been nice.<P>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-22-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 05-23-2001).]||||reg||14
